      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.5,
      "end_seconds": 11.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "hello, thanks for fitting me in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.01,
      "end_seconds": 15.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.03,
      "end_seconds": 20.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.92,
      "end_seconds": 22.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.44,
      "end_seconds": 29.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "I wanted to get a severe headache for days looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 31.84,
      "end_seconds": 39.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay so the vitals from earlier. Respiratory rate 16 saturation 97 percent blood pressure 166 over 93 heart rate 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.04,
      "end_seconds": 43.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.42,
      "end_seconds": 48.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I've had it for about two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.47,
      "end_seconds": 63.07,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.72,
      "end_seconds": 77.76,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "mostly moderate it's a few times a day oh and and being sick had that since this morning. Double vision was there but it's gone away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.65,
      "end_seconds": 85.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Have you had a severe headache for days before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.7,
      "end_seconds": 94.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "Yes something like this happened about six months ago and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.8,
      "end_seconds": 101.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Did you get head injury fever or weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.63,
      "end_seconds": 109.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "No, no head injury, fever or weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.89,
      "end_seconds": 114.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.23,
      "end_seconds": 118.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.51,
      "end_seconds": 122.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "your breathing any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.55,
      "end_seconds": 126.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.1,
      "end_seconds": 133.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.12,
      "end_seconds": 138.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I don't think I have any no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.57,
      "end_seconds": 157.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.89,
      "end_seconds": 172.85,
      "duration_seconds": 13.96,
      "text": "I had a bunion operation six years ago. Sorry I know I'm rambling a bit. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.36,
      "end_seconds": 177.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.34,
      "end_seconds": 194.96,
      "duration_seconds": 15.62,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I hardly move around during the day. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.9,
      "end_seconds": 201.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.73,
      "end_seconds": 210.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.86,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Alright, an enlarged prostate, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.26,
      "end_seconds": 227.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.86,
      "end_seconds": 234.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "It's tamsulosin 0.4 milligrams at night. It's the contraceptive pill daily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.54,
      "end_seconds": 239.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.64,
      "end_seconds": 241.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.93,
      "end_seconds": 245.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.99,
      "end_seconds": 260.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "The optic discs look swollen and you are drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.94,
      "end_seconds": 280.3,
      "duration_seconds": 14.36,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, thinking it it through, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at possible cerebral venous thrombosis or raised pressure in the head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.72,
      "end_seconds": 304.36,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "An urgent CT venogram is what I'd like next for possible venous thrombosis. Stop the pill you need an urgent scan and admission. I'd like you back straight away. Okay does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.5,
      "end_seconds": 307.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
    }
  ]
